# Normalise line endings to LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# Without this, git checks out CRLF on Windows and every single file fails
# `prettier --check`, which made `npm run verify` unusable there — 70 files
# reported as misformatted when nothing was wrong with any of them.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary-ish things git should not touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
